      "text": "# Transactional Inventory Ledger: Design & Reference Implementation\n\n## 1. Design Overview\n\nThis system implements an **append-only, double-entry-style inventory ledger** in SQLite with:\n- **Idempotent transactions** via client-generated UUIDs\n- **Optimistic concurrency control** with version checks\n- **Audit invariants** enforced at the database level\n- **Safe migrations** with rollback support\n- **Full test coverage**\n\n### Core Principles\n1. **Append-only**: Never UPDATE or DELETE ledger entries; corrections are new entries\n2. **Idempotency**: Re-submitting the same transaction ID is a no-op\n3. **Consistency**: Stock levels are derived from ledger entries, never stored directly\n4. **Auditability**: Every change is traceable to a transaction with timestamp, actor, and reason\n\n---\n\n## 2. Schema Design\n\n```sql\n-- ============================================================\n-- INVENTORY LEDGER SCHEMA\n-- ============================================================\n\n-- Products: static catalog (not part of ledger)\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS products (\n    product_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    name         TEXT NOT NULL,\n    sku          TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n    created_at   TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now')),\n    is_active    INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1 CHECK (is_active IN (0, 1))\n);\n\n-- Ledger: append-only transaction log\n-- Each row represents a single inventory movement\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS ledger (\n    ledger_id    INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n    txn_id       TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,          -- Client-generated UUID for idempotency\n    product_id   TEXT NOT NULL,\n    quantity     INTEGER NOT NULL,              -- Positive = inbound, Negative = outbound\n    txn_type     TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (txn_type IN (\n                     'PURCHASE', 'SALE', 'RETURN', 'ADJUSTMENT', 'TRANSFER_IN', 'TRANSFER_OUT'\n                 )),\n    reference    TEXT,                          -- External reference (PO#, order#, etc.)\n    actor        TEXT NOT NULL,                 -- Who performed the action\n    reason       TEXT,                          -- Human-readable reason\n    created_at   TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now')),\n    FOREIGN KEY (product_id) REFERENCES products(product_id)\n);\n\n-- Indexes for performance\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_ledger_product ON ledger(product_id);\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_ledger_txn_id ON ledger(txn_id);\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_ledger_created ON ledger(created_at);\n\n-- Materialized view: current stock per product\n-- Updated via triggers to maintain consistency\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS stock_levels (\n    product_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    quantity     INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n    version      INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,    -- Optimistic concurrency control\n    updated_at   TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now')),\n    FOREIGN KEY (product_id) REFERENCES products(product_id)\n);\n\n-- Trigger: update stock_levels on ledger insert\nCREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS trg_ledger_insert\nAFTER INSERT ON ledger\nBEGIN\n    INSERT INTO stock_levels (product_id, quantity, version, updated_at)\n    VALUES (NEW.product_id, NEW.quantity, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now'))\n    ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET\n        quantity = quantity + NEW.quantity,\n        version = version + 1,\n        updated_at = strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now');\nEND;\n\n-- Audit log: tracks schema changes and critical operations\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS audit_log (\n    audit_id     INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n    event_type   TEXT NOT NULL,                 -- 'MIGRATION', 'SCHEMA_CHANGE', 'DATA_CORRECTION'\n    details      TEXT NOT NULL,                 -- JSON payload\n    actor        TEXT NOT NULL,\n    created_at   TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now'))\n);\n\n-- Migration tracking\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS schema_migrations (\n    version      INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,\n    name         TEXT NOT NULL,\n    applied_at   TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%fZ', 'now')),\n    checksum     TEXT NOT NULL                  -- SHA256 of migration SQL\n);\n```\n\n### Key Design Decisions\n\n| Aspect | Decision | Rationale |\n|--------|----------|-----------|\n| Stock storage | Derived via trigger | Single source of truth; prevents drift |\n| Idemp",
